# Loading Button — a pill that runs a fake 2s mutation: idle "Check Transaction"
# -> "Analyzing Transaction" (Skia spinner, withRepeat rotation) -> alternately
# "Transaction Safe" (check SVG) or "Transaction Unsafe" (lock SVG), then resets
# to idle after 1.5s; width/colour animate with layout + CSS transition.
# What this test covers: the success path, the error path, pressing repeatedly
# while loading (must be ignored), pressing again right when the result shows
# (a new mutation while the previous reset timer is still pending), and letting
# everything settle back to idle.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/loading-button"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 45000
wait "text" "Check Transaction" 10000
# Warm-up tap on empty space: the first touch of a test starts the XCTest
# runner (several seconds), which must not eat into the 1.5s result window.
press 200 780
wait 800
# 1st run -> success.
press "label=\"Check Transaction\""
wait "text" "Analyzing Transaction" 3000
# A press while loading must be ignored (isLoading guard).
press 200 437
wait "text" "Transaction Safe" 5000
wait "text" "Check Transaction" 5000
wait 500
# 2nd run -> error (thrown inside the mutation, caught by the handler).
press "label=\"Check Transaction\""
wait "text" "Analyzing Transaction" 3000
wait "text" "Transaction Unsafe" 5000
wait "text" "Check Transaction" 5000
wait 500
# 3rd run -> success, then press again while "Transaction Safe" is showing.
press "label=\"Check Transaction\""
wait "text" "Transaction Safe" 6000
press 200 437
wait 300
press 200 437
wait "text" "Transaction Unsafe" 8000
wait "text" "Check Transaction" 8000
wait 3000
wait "text" "Check Transaction" 3000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
